      "title": "Expansion strategy distribution",
      "description": "Count of gateway_output turns by decomposition strategy (single/hybrid/decompose/delegate), 90d window -- covers the full emission history since strategy telemetry began 2026-04-15. decompose and delegate are rare (2 and 17 all-time) so a narrower window would misrepresent them as zero.",
